repository-code: "https://github.com/USUARIO/ALU_VHDL"

abstract: >
  Design and implementation of a 16-bit Arithmetic Logic Unit (ALU)
  on a Terasic DE0-Nano SoC FPGA using VHDL. The project includes
  the complete source code, Quartus project files, documentation,
  and supporting material.

keywords:
  - FPGA
  - VHDL
  - ALU
  - Intel Quartus Prime
  - Cyclone V
  - DE0-Nano SoC

